WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.325 --> 00:39.837
=Episode 16=

00:39.885 --> 00:42.600
(Close Relatives Cannot Marry)

00:43.160 --> 00:47.000
Your Majesty, please grant them
the marriage decree as soon as possible.

00:47.559 --> 00:48.360
Father,

00:48.679 --> 00:50.440
I don't want to get married yet.

00:52.400 --> 00:53.199
Nonsense.

00:53.640 --> 00:55.000
How can you not get married?

00:55.000 --> 00:55.800
Father,

00:55.800 --> 00:57.240
Si is still very young,

00:57.320 --> 00:59.160
and Mother still needs to look after Si.

00:59.359 --> 01:01.679
Besides, Mother's health
is not what it used to be.

01:02.000 --> 01:04.120
All the external affairs
are being handled by me.

01:04.920 --> 01:05.719
Ning'an,

01:07.090 --> 01:08.719
we grew up together
as childhood friends.

01:08.839 --> 01:09.640
Don't worry.

01:09.679 --> 01:11.679
I will keep your mom's
well-being in mind.

01:11.960 --> 01:12.760
That's right.

01:12.839 --> 01:13.640
Ning'an,

01:13.920 --> 01:16.200
you are also familiar with my home.

01:19.280 --> 01:21.840
(It looks like Ning'an doesn't agree.)

01:26.200 --> 01:27.000
Ning'an,

01:27.640 --> 01:28.439
how about this?

01:29.119 --> 01:30.240
Let His Majesty

01:31.000 --> 01:32.560
and my father talk here first.

01:32.840 --> 01:34.039
Let's go for a walk outside.

01:34.040 --> 01:35.880
It's been a long time since
we've seen the Imperial Garden, right?

01:35.880 --> 01:36.719
I'm not going.

01:37.000 --> 01:38.240
I went there this morning.

01:38.240 --> 01:39.159
It was quite boring.

01:39.640 --> 01:40.920
I've been very busy lately,

01:41.640 --> 01:43.039
and I just want to take a day off.

01:43.520 --> 01:44.600
I don't want to go anywhere.

01:48.640 --> 01:50.959
Ning'an has indeed worked hard lately.

01:51.079 --> 01:53.480
There is no rush regarding this matter.

01:54.560 --> 01:55.359
Since

01:55.879 --> 01:57.439
Her Highness is tired,

01:57.760 --> 01:58.959
my son and I

01:59.079 --> 02:01.560
will go pay our respects
to the Empress first.

02:02.480 --> 02:04.079
We shall take our leave.

02:04.400 --> 02:05.200
Go on.

02:05.200 --> 02:07.719
You and your sister
haven't seen each other in a long time.

02:07.719 --> 02:08.439
Yes, Your Majesty.

02:17.475 --> 02:18.737
(Wei Mansion)

02:18.760 --> 02:19.560
Aunt,

02:19.680 --> 02:20.599
I'm back.

02:22.079 --> 02:22.879
Hao,

02:23.680 --> 02:25.079
you're out of prison?

02:25.120 --> 02:26.480
His Majesty agreed to let you come back?

02:26.480 --> 02:27.400
Of course.

02:28.310 --> 02:30.040
If he didn't let me out,
I'd give him heck.

02:30.040 --> 02:31.590
I've been locked up
for so long, you know?

02:31.920 --> 02:32.599
Young Master,

02:32.599 --> 02:33.519
you're back?

02:34.079 --> 02:36.239
I've finished the stove
you told me to make

02:36.239 --> 02:37.359
before you went to jail.

02:37.480 --> 02:38.159
Let's go.

02:38.159 --> 02:38.990
Let's go have a look.

02:59.800 --> 03:00.919
You spendthrift.

03:01.000 --> 03:02.960
Why are you tearing down
the house for no reason?

03:03.479 --> 03:04.970
This isn't how you tear down a house.

03:05.120 --> 03:06.400
I'm installing a stove.

03:08.280 --> 03:09.919
What is this thing even for?

03:11.439 --> 03:13.120
You'll find out in a moment.

03:19.520 --> 03:20.319
Mister Wang,

03:20.639 --> 03:22.400
bring me my firewood and the kettle.

03:22.400 --> 03:23.120
Right away.

03:24.800 --> 03:25.960
Just messing around.

03:26.159 --> 03:27.120
What a waste of iron.

03:27.360 --> 03:28.199
This iron was meant

03:28.199 --> 03:30.240
for the farm tools next year.

03:30.240 --> 03:31.360
It's hard to come by.

03:31.360 --> 03:31.960
Young Master,

03:31.960 --> 03:33.319
have you lost your mind?

03:33.319 --> 03:34.960
You're installing a stove in this room.

03:34.960 --> 03:36.599
The smoke will fill the entire house.

03:36.599 --> 03:37.919
How can anyone stay in here?

04:00.879 --> 04:02.599
How come no smoke is coming out?

04:04.360 --> 04:05.280
See that?

04:05.400 --> 04:06.400
No smoke.

04:06.840 --> 04:08.159
And it won't be toxic either.

04:08.560 --> 04:10.120
This pipe leads to the outside.

04:11.360 --> 04:12.290
If you don't believe me,

04:12.319 --> 04:13.439
go look outside the window.

04:21.560 --> 04:22.439
Indeed.

04:22.960 --> 04:25.240
All the smoke is
going outside the house.

04:25.319 --> 04:26.039
Alright,

04:26.039 --> 04:27.120
close the window.

04:27.120 --> 04:28.719
It's freezing with it open in winter.

04:32.039 --> 04:34.280
The room has really warmed up a lot.

04:34.280 --> 04:35.000
This thing

04:35.270 --> 04:36.719
works well for boiling water, too.

04:36.719 --> 04:37.439
Now,

04:37.439 --> 04:39.159
we can have hot water anytime.

04:39.960 --> 04:41.599
I'm even starting to feel a bit hot.

04:42.240 --> 04:44.560
I didn't expect this stove
to actually work.

04:44.560 --> 04:47.120
When have I ever
made something that didn't work?

04:47.159 --> 04:47.919
Come on.

04:51.400 --> 04:52.719
It's comfortable now.

04:53.240 --> 04:54.719
Nothing feels cold to the touch.

04:55.000 --> 04:56.670
And we won't run out
of hot water at home.

05:00.480 --> 05:01.240
Young Madam,

05:01.240 --> 05:01.959
Young Master,

05:02.160 --> 05:03.160
with this thing,

05:03.279 --> 05:05.040
we're going to save a lot of charcoal.

05:05.600 --> 05:07.199
The mansion has plenty of firewood.

05:07.600 --> 05:08.720
Besides, the woodcutters

05:08.720 --> 05:10.439
come to the capital
to sell wood every day,

05:10.439 --> 05:12.399
so restocking will be convenient.

05:14.399 --> 05:15.199
Comfortable.

05:16.000 --> 05:17.839
This way, it won't be cold
during the winter.

05:20.560 --> 05:21.360
Mister Wang.

05:22.399 --> 05:23.519
There's only one of these?

05:23.519 --> 05:24.160
Are there more?

05:24.720 --> 05:25.519
There are,

05:25.560 --> 05:26.600
it's just that they're not

05:26.600 --> 05:27.800
quite finished yet.

05:28.959 --> 05:29.480
Let's go.

05:29.639 --> 05:30.480
Take me to see them.

05:30.800 --> 05:31.319
Let's go.

05:34.279 --> 05:37.079
How did Hao become so brilliant?

05:37.160 --> 05:38.800
In these ways of enjoying life,

05:38.800 --> 05:40.399
the Young Master is an expert.

05:42.600 --> 05:44.839
Hao isn't only good at enjoying life.

05:45.839 --> 05:47.199
Now, the Wei Mansion

05:47.319 --> 05:49.560
is the most illustrious
residence in West City.

05:49.720 --> 05:51.560
With the highly
profitable Juxian Restaurant

05:51.560 --> 05:52.759
and the glaze workshop,

05:52.879 --> 05:54.959
who doesn't know
our family produced a Marquis?

05:55.480 --> 05:57.720
Who could have
a brighter future than our family?

05:58.600 --> 05:59.720
They used to say

05:59.879 --> 06:01.399
the Wei family produced a fool.

06:01.639 --> 06:04.079
But does anyone dare to mock Hao now?

06:04.319 --> 06:05.519
So what if he was a fool?

06:05.680 --> 06:07.040
Even a fool was made a Marquis,

06:07.319 --> 06:09.839
and he will marry
the Eldest Princess in the future.

06:10.279 --> 06:11.720
Who else has such a capability?

06:13.120 --> 06:14.000
Young Madam,

06:15.000 --> 06:16.600
what are you talking about?

06:20.720 --> 06:21.519
Young Madam,

06:21.639 --> 06:23.439
a lady calling herself Wei Ning'an

06:23.439 --> 06:24.399
has come to visit.

06:24.519 --> 06:25.319
What?

06:25.680 --> 06:26.879
Young Lady Ning'an is here?

06:27.000 --> 06:28.110
Quickly, open the main gates.

06:28.120 --> 06:28.800
Yes, Young Madam.

06:31.879 --> 06:32.959
Go inform Hao at once.

06:32.959 --> 06:34.560
Tell him the Eldest Princess
has arrived.

06:34.600 --> 06:35.519
Young Madam,

06:35.800 --> 06:37.199
have you lost your mind?

06:37.199 --> 06:39.300
Why would the Eldest Princess
come to our mansion?

06:39.759 --> 06:40.759
Just go.

06:42.737 --> 06:44.012
(Wei Mansion)

06:53.537 --> 06:54.600
(Wei Mansion)

06:55.120 --> 06:56.879
Greetings, Your Highness.

06:58.959 --> 07:00.160
(It seems Young Lady Lin)

07:00.160 --> 07:01.720
(already knows my identity.)

07:03.140 --> 07:04.959
Sis Luo, there's no need
for such formality.

07:05.959 --> 07:06.680
From now on,

07:06.680 --> 07:08.240
unless it's a formal occasion,

07:08.279 --> 07:09.920
you don't need to bow to me.

07:09.959 --> 07:12.160
Otherwise, I wouldn't dare come again.

07:12.279 --> 07:13.079
Sis

07:13.279 --> 07:14.240
Luo?

07:15.399 --> 07:16.759
Your Highness might not know,

07:16.759 --> 07:18.279
but I am actually Wei Hao's aunt.

07:18.279 --> 07:19.279
I know that.

07:19.399 --> 07:21.199
But you are so beautiful,

07:21.279 --> 07:23.199
I feel I should call you "Sis."

07:23.800 --> 07:25.519
Thank you for the compliment,
Your Highness.

07:25.519 --> 07:25.920
Please,

07:25.920 --> 07:26.600
(Wei Mansion)
come inside.

07:26.600 --> 07:27.399
It's cold out here.

07:27.879 --> 07:29.199
I'm here to see Wei Hao.

07:29.199 --> 07:30.160
Is Wei Hao in?

07:30.160 --> 07:30.720
He's...

07:30.720 --> 07:31.519
Hello, Girl.

07:32.279 --> 07:33.240
What brings you here?

07:34.110 --> 07:35.439
Coming out in such cold weather,

07:35.439 --> 07:36.390
aren't you afraid of the chill?

07:38.399 --> 07:38.920
Come.

07:39.199 --> 07:40.240
Follow me to the loft.

07:41.240 --> 07:41.879
Aunt,

07:42.199 --> 07:43.439
don't follow us.

07:43.959 --> 07:45.959
I have things to
discuss with the Princess.

07:47.759 --> 07:49.800
(Anything this fool says)

07:49.839 --> 07:50.879
(ends up sounding wrong.)

07:59.412 --> 08:01.350
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

08:01.360 --> 08:02.160
Move it.

08:02.750 --> 08:06.225
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

08:07.050 --> 08:09.987
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

08:10.387 --> 08:12.962
♪Sigh and walk away♪

08:14.439 --> 08:15.800
How are your hands so warm?

08:16.279 --> 08:17.120
You rogue.

08:17.120 --> 08:18.199
I have a hand warmer.

08:18.439 --> 08:19.480
What are you saying?

08:19.879 --> 08:20.759
You're my wife.

08:20.759 --> 08:22.500
How is holding your hand being a rogue?

08:23.079 --> 08:24.600
So what if you have a hand warmer?

08:24.920 --> 08:25.439
Get in.

08:28.800 --> 08:29.839
This room

08:30.120 --> 08:31.319
is what you call warm.

08:32.399 --> 08:33.240
Why

08:33.720 --> 08:35.160
is it so warm?

08:40.399 --> 08:41.439
What is this?

08:44.839 --> 08:46.639
It's smaller than
the stoves in the palace,

08:46.920 --> 08:48.959
yet it can warm up the entire room.

08:49.879 --> 08:50.879
This is a heater.

08:50.959 --> 08:53.399
If you put this in your home in winter,
it gets especially warm.

08:53.480 --> 08:54.360
A heater?

08:55.199 --> 08:56.040
That's wonderful.

08:56.319 --> 08:57.160
This way,

08:57.160 --> 08:58.120
I won't have to wear

08:58.120 --> 08:59.839
such heavy clothes indoors anymore.

09:01.839 --> 09:02.680
You like it?

09:04.480 --> 09:05.639
Once we are married,

09:06.120 --> 09:08.399
I'll install floor heating
in our new house.

09:08.879 --> 09:09.680
When that time comes,

09:10.120 --> 09:11.240
you can run around

09:11.240 --> 09:12.199
the house barefoot.

09:13.000 --> 09:14.519
Who said I was going to marry you?

09:15.200 --> 09:16.159
My father

09:16.600 --> 09:18.279
is going to betroth me to my cousin.

09:19.200 --> 09:20.000
What?

09:20.279 --> 09:21.080
Your cousin?

09:24.279 --> 09:26.399
How can my father-in-law break his word?

09:26.919 --> 09:28.919
Besides, is there something wrong
with his head?

09:28.919 --> 09:30.960
Inbreeding will lead
to deformed children.

09:31.510 --> 09:32.720
No way, I have to go find him.

09:33.039 --> 09:34.440
What do you mean by "inbreeding?"

09:34.440 --> 09:35.720
And what are "deformed children?"

09:37.240 --> 09:38.320
Well, this...

09:40.440 --> 09:41.960
It's when you marry a relative,

09:41.960 --> 09:43.720
and if you're related
within three generations,

09:43.720 --> 09:45.159
it's very easy to give birth

09:45.600 --> 09:47.639
to the mentally disabled
or those missing limbs.

09:47.639 --> 09:48.480
You are not even

09:48.519 --> 09:49.720
able to give birth at all.

09:49.720 --> 09:51.200
Issues occur while
the baby is still in the womb,

09:51.200 --> 09:52.440
leading to difficult labor.

09:52.720 --> 09:54.840
How can your father
put you in such a bad situation?

09:55.039 --> 09:56.159
Nonsense.

09:56.480 --> 09:57.879
How could such a thing happen?

09:58.559 --> 10:00.519
Marrying within
the family to strengthen ties

10:00.519 --> 10:01.720
happens everywhere around here.

10:01.720 --> 10:03.720
Then, why don't you
go check for yourself?

10:03.840 --> 10:04.639
If you look into it,

10:04.840 --> 10:06.799
you'll see how many
children don't even survive.

10:08.000 --> 10:09.759
Are you telling the truth?

10:10.159 --> 10:11.960
Why would I lie to you about this?

10:12.810 --> 10:13.840
What's your cousin's name?

10:15.080 --> 10:16.840
I can't tell you his name.

10:17.200 --> 10:18.840
But he really is an annoying person.

10:19.240 --> 10:20.320
He thinks I don't know,

10:20.639 --> 10:22.200
but he always visits pleasure boats.

10:22.240 --> 10:23.159
In his courtyard,

10:23.200 --> 10:24.759
he even has several maids

10:24.799 --> 10:25.919
who are his concubines.

10:26.399 --> 10:27.990
He's seven or eight years older than me,

10:28.080 --> 10:29.360
and he still wants to marry me.

10:30.039 --> 10:31.120
Isn't he just a jerk?

10:31.120 --> 10:31.919
Even more of a jerk than me.

10:31.919 --> 10:32.840
Give me his address.

10:32.840 --> 10:34.279
I have to give him a beating

10:34.380 --> 10:35.519
to help you vent your anger.

10:36.600 --> 10:37.639
To help me vent?

10:37.639 --> 10:38.799
I'm clearly the angrier one.

10:38.919 --> 10:40.320
How dare he eye my wife!

10:43.720 --> 10:44.440
Wait a second...

10:44.720 --> 10:45.840
Your cousin

10:46.360 --> 10:50.679
is the son of your mother's brother.

10:52.000 --> 10:54.039
If I beat my mother-in-law's nephew,
then she...

10:54.039 --> 10:56.150
♪Pearls spill and scatter
across white jade steps♪

10:57.320 --> 10:58.720
I'll wear a mask.

10:58.879 --> 10:59.679
How's that?

11:00.559 --> 11:01.639
Pathetic.

11:02.159 --> 11:03.559
Is this all the courage you have?

11:05.039 --> 11:06.720
When have I ever been afraid of anyone?

11:06.919 --> 11:08.360
But you are where I draw the line.

11:08.360 --> 11:08.879
I...

11:08.960 --> 11:11.080
I'm wearing a mask
because I don't want to upset her.

11:13.759 --> 11:15.279
As long as you understand.

11:15.759 --> 11:18.799
I don't want to make things
hard for my parents either,

11:19.320 --> 11:20.320
but I know

11:20.759 --> 11:22.559
that they are both on your side.

11:24.200 --> 11:27.012
♪The imperial kitchen
and stir up storms in business♪

11:27.200 --> 11:27.879
Really?

11:29.600 --> 11:32.240
It seems all my calling
them "Father-in-law and Mother-in-law"

11:32.240 --> 11:33.480
hasn't been for nothing.

11:34.240 --> 11:34.960
Let go.

11:36.037 --> 11:37.862
♪The playboy transforms♪

11:38.480 --> 11:39.360
Wei Hao!

11:40.000 --> 11:41.440
You want to lose your ears, don't you?

11:41.440 --> 11:42.190
You can't catch me.

11:50.175 --> 11:53.005
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

11:53.625 --> 11:57.025
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

11:57.795 --> 12:00.745
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

12:01.085 --> 12:03.785
♪Sigh and walk away♪

12:05.385 --> 12:08.855
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

12:08.855 --> 12:11.085
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

12:11.085 --> 12:13.195
♪Colors and darkness♪

12:13.195 --> 12:15.215
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

12:15.215 --> 12:19.575
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

12:21.015 --> 12:24.745
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

12:25.015 --> 12:28.615
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

12:28.775 --> 12:30.855
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

12:30.855 --> 12:35.645
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

12:35.865 --> 12:37.485
♪The world mistakes me♪

12:37.485 --> 12:39.825
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

12:39.895 --> 12:41.085
♪As the storm approaches♪

12:41.085 --> 12:43.485
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

12:43.695 --> 12:45.415
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

12:45.415 --> 12:47.395
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

12:47.565 --> 12:49.315
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

12:49.315 --> 12:51.415
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

12:51.415 --> 12:52.885
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

12:52.885 --> 12:55.115
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

12:55.335 --> 12:56.535
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

12:56.535 --> 12:59.055
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

12:59.185 --> 13:00.895
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

13:00.895 --> 13:02.175
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

13:02.325 --> 13:03.745
♪My wish has finally come true♪

13:03.745 --> 13:04.785
♪To stay by your side♪

13:04.785 --> 13:06.705
♪In this fleeting world♪

13:06.875 --> 13:10.125
♪We are free and happy♪

13:14.125 --> 13:15.905
♪From a nobody♪

13:15.905 --> 13:17.805
♪To someone now famous♪

13:17.915 --> 13:19.345
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

13:19.345 --> 13:21.855
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

13:21.955 --> 13:23.535
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

13:23.535 --> 13:25.605
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

13:25.815 --> 13:27.495
♪In this vast world♪

13:27.495 --> 13:29.495
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

13:29.645 --> 13:31.855
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

13:31.855 --> 13:33.445
♪Everything ends eventually♪

13:33.535 --> 13:35.035
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

13:35.035 --> 13:37.435
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

13:37.435 --> 13:39.145
♪No matter how time flies♪

13:39.145 --> 13:40.305
♪Even if the falling snow♪

13:40.305 --> 13:41.935
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

13:41.935 --> 13:42.975
♪All I want now♪

13:42.975 --> 13:45.075
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

13:45.075 --> 13:48.335
♪Year after year♪
